dnstable
------------------------------------------
dnstable implements an encoding format for passive DNS data. It consists of a C
library, libdnstable, and several command line utilities for creating,
querying, and merging dnstable data files.

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libdnstable-devel-0.14.0-1bl2
  libdnstable0-0.14.0-1bl2
  libmtbl-devel-1.7.1-1bl2
  libmtbl1-1.7.1-1bl2
  libwdns1-0.13.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  jq-1.8.1-1
  libmtbl-devel-1.7.1-1bl2
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libwdns-devel-0.13.0-1bl1
  make-4.4.1-2
  mtbl-1.7.1-1bl2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/farsightsec/dnstable

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/farsightsec/dnstable/archive/refs/tags/tags/v0.14.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack dnstable-0.14.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./dnstable-0.14.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/dnstable-0.14.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/dnstable-0.14.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdnstable0-0.14.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdnstable-devel-0.14.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

